23/Sep/21 7:27 PM;557058:443ab871-4096-403e-bd6f-f3534fe417f0;The good news: exporting worked\! (We had to delete the existing branch so it could start afresh. Remember this for every export: merge, then delete.)

The bad news: we use ISO codes for locales and Phrase uses RFC-5646. This resulted in some of our exported files being misnamed; they need to match the ISO codes in our database, which in turn need to match the available_locales list in our application configuration because of how we determine which locale to send an email in: {{I18n.with_locale(Locale.find(@user.preference.preferred_locale).iso)}}

So we’re not quite done yet.

