After [https://otwarchive.atlassian.net/browse/AO3-4008#icft=AO3-4008|https://otwarchive.atlassian.net/browse/AO3-4008#icft=AO3-4008|smart-link] this happened, where the first line of the list of kudos names is not cleared of the left of the feedback buttons:  

!image (2).png|width=200,height=183!

This happened as a result of rearranging the contents of {{div#feedback}}. It used to go:

* {{div#kudos_message}}
* comment section {{h3.landmark.heading}}, which has the {{clear: both}} style
* comment flash {{div}}
* {{div#kudos}}

And now it goes:

* {{div#kudos_message}}
* kudos flash {{div}}
* {{div#kudos}}
* comment section {{h3.landmark.heading}}

While we could solve this by applying {{clear: both}} to {{div#kudos}}, instead adding a new landmark ({{<h3 class="landmark heading">Kudos</h3>}}) would allow users who navigate by heading to jump to the kudos section specifically.

