The earliest fixed version is {{5.2.6.}}{quote}

*Testing*

The pull request also updated the i18n and nokigiri gems, so let’s check

* kudos emails work okay (these are i18n’ed)
* the delete account confirmation page looks okay (this is i18n’ed; no need to actually delete)
* posting and importing works with formatting works

Since we upgraded the base image to ruby:2.7.3 we've unintentionally upgraded bundler as well.

This line of the docker file:

{noformat}RUN gem install bundler -v 1.17.3 && bundle install{noformat}

No longer sets the correct version of bundler since the 2.1.4 install that comes with the base image takes precedence.

Probably need to uninstall bundler entirely then reinstall 1.17.3 in the Dockerfile so we match versions with production.

*Reproduce:*

{{docker run -it ruby:2.7.3 bash}}
{{gem install bundler -v 1.17.3}}
{{bundle version}}

Note the version returned is 2.1.4

*Testing Instructions:*

{{docker compose -d --build}}
{{docker compose exec web bundle version}}
{{docker compose exec web bundler version}}

Should always return 1.17.3 as the version

