column149:
10/Dec/21 4:05 PM;557058:f99670ac-6f0b-469b-bdfb-a9817a67932f;Priscilla:

{quote}I think there's an error with Croatian ({{hr}}) emails with pluralisation. neither invitation request approved nor denied notifications are arriving in the case of 5+ invitations for Croatian. the {{other}} plural seems to be filled out on Phrase and Github (it's a {{one/few/other}} language).do your logs have any indication of what the problem might be? the account would be {{translation_croatian}}.{quote}

Phrase follows CLDR rules, where [Croatian has one/few/other|https://unicode-org.github.io/cldr-staging/charts/latest/supplemental/language_plural_rules.html#hr] but rails-i18n expects [one/few/other/many|https://github.com/svenfuchs/rails-i18n/blob/f6cc43ec8cfc08d0db7a06ca8299d7834c517a05/lib/rails_i18n/common_pluralizations/east_slavic.rb#L37] for Croatian.

