{quote}Updated the FNOK for AccountA to be AccountC: got the success message, got the ‘new FNOK added' on AccountA, and on AccountC the FNOK message showed up as well. However, there was no message on AccountA that AccountB had been removed as FNOK, and no message on AccountB that they had been removed as FNOK. As far as I'm aware a user can only have one FNOK at a time and the new replaces the old (the FNOK display field doesn’t allow multiple names and I can only imagine that from a legal perspective multiples would not be ideal…), so this is confusing when looking at AccountB particularly.{quote}

