16/Sep/24 6:16 PM;557058:48d6a38e-168b-4aa7-a58d-a1853a844295;Some more details about the attribute:

{quote}The {{name}} content attribute gives the name of the group of related {{details}} elements that the element is a member of. Opening one member of this group causes other members of the group to close. ([source|https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interactive-elements.html#attr-details-name]){quote}

At the minute, we allow the {{<details>}} element in work summaries, so that could allow one work’s summary to interact with others' if they have the same {{name}}. So, to avoid that (very undesirable) behaviour, we’re going to continue _blocking_ this attribute from use.

column30:
To help the Support committee with their ticket volume, we should add the following text to CONTRIBUTING.md anywhere we mention “please [contact the AO3 Support team|https://archiveofourown.org/support]”.

{quote}Our Support team is staffed by volunteers, so please wait for a response before submitting another ticket. Duplicate submissions will not make things happen faster.{quote}

Additionally, we can highlight ADT’s own email list by adding

{quote}We do not have a public chat, but you are welcome to contact us at [otw-coders@transformativeworks.org|mailto:otw-coders@transformativeworks.org] if you have any questions.{quote}

to the README’s ["How to contribute" section|https://github.com/otwcode/otwarchive/tree/d1a63622444b1d7b0ba1f4b9b3c77896178a5c20?tab=readme-ov-file#how-to-contribute].

